klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11703777","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-07","type":"entitlement","what":"股息登记截止日","what_en":"Dividend entitlement date","ann":"11703559","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11703559","src":"ai"},{"date":"2027-01-05","type":"payment","what":"股息派发日","what_en":"Dividend payment date","ann":"11703777","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11703777","src":"ai"},{"date":"2027-01-05","type":"payment","what":"股息派发日","what_en":"Dividend payment date","ann":"11703559","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11703559","src":"ai"}],"recent_en":"In October 2026, Divfex announced RM120 million worth of data centre equipment contracts in Penang, and in November completed a share subscription in Excel Commerce Solutions, reducing its stake to 48.11% and making it an associate company. The company also reported a 69% year-on-year jump in 1QFY2027 net profit to RM1.85 million and declared a first interim dividend of 0.2 sen per share.","notable_en":["Secured RM120 million worth of data centre equipment contracts in Penang.","Completed the share subscription in Excel Commerce Solutions, reducing its stake from 51.0% to 48.11% and making Excel an associate company.","Declared a first interim single-tier dividend of 0.2 sen per share for FY2027."],"risks_en":["Directors, including Executive Vice Chairman Dato' Dr Tan Seng Chuan, filed notices of intention to deal during the closed period.","Excel is no longer a subsidiary but an associate, and the company continues to provide corporate guarantees to Excel."],"earnings_en":"For the final quarter of FY2026 (ended 30 June), revenue was RM21.75 million, up 29.4% quarter-on-quarter but down 52.6% year-on-year; net profit was RM1.338 million with a net margin of 6.2%, down 74.9% year-on-year."}